This is a graph-wiki workspace — a per-repo container for plugin-managed knowledge. The Obsidian vault opens at `wiki/` (the code wiki); `raw/` and the files below are siblings of that vault.

## Local Config
- `.graph-wiki.local.yaml` — per-machine overrides (e.g. `graph-wiki-directory:` to relocate the workspace). At repository root. Gitignored.

## Layout

- `raw/` — immutable ingested sources (specs, PRs, articles, transcripts). The LLM reads from here but never writes.
- `wiki/` — the code wiki and Obsidian vault (entity pages under `entities/`, plus `concepts/`, `sources/`, `adrs/`, `work/`, and `guidance/`). See [`wiki/CLAUDE.md`](wiki/CLAUDE.md) when present.
- `.graph-wiki.yaml` — workspace manifest. Lists registered plugins.
- `.graph-wiki/` - Local graph-wiki graphs, traces, and caches. Gitignored.


